/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team of mercenaries, not cards. Mercenary units can be enhanced and modified in various ways along the journey, offering new strategic combinations every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different journeys with 140+ mercenaries and traits, 80+ relics, and 400+ card events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover diverse combinations, build support facilities in campsites, make the ultimate expedition team of your dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/fdad6fc6861f3ceb0601858ced9582ea.avif?t=1754381980\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new game you play will be perceived differently from the previous experience, with diverse events and randomly generated paths &amp; enemies. 120+ types of mercenaries, 80+ types of relics, 14+ types of building events, and 400+ card events will contribute to creating an infinitely replayable game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Building Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/eded564fa133bd72e2b6c920ce73b329.poster.avif?t=1754381980\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/eded564fa133bd72e2b6c920ce73b329.webm?t=1754381980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009310/extras/eded564fa133bd72e2b6c920ce73b329.mp4?t=1754381980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><sp